# PIR — Platform Integrity Registry
## LD-311 | 25 Alpha LLC | Carlton A. James — Founder & Chief AI Officer
## Mandatory for every platform in the 25 Alpha ecosystem — June 25, 2026

Every platform built here is registered in X.R.A.Y.'s Platform Integrity Registry (PIR).
No platform goes LIVE without passing the enterprise acceptance gate.

### What PIR Is
PIR is the 25 Alpha ecosystem's universal quality enforcement layer, living in xray_platform.
It runs 17 audit dimensions against every platform before go-live and on a continuous schedule.
The AUDITOR agent (S239) runs all dimensions. Results write to platform_audit_registry (immutable, 7-year retention).

### Enterprise Acceptance Gate — LD-311 (HARD REQUIREMENT)
Before ANY platform flips from dark to live, it must pass:

| Threshold | Requirement |
|---|---|
| Average score | ≥ 85/100 across all scored dimensions |
| Carlton flags | = 0 |
| AUD-06 Security | ≥ 70 (hard floor — non-negotiable) |
